&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p data-pm-slice=&quot;1 1 []&quot;&gt;Zscaler (NASDAQ: ZS) accelerates digital transformation so customers can be more agile, efficient, resilient, and secure. The Zscaler Zero Trust Exchange™️ platform protects thousands of customers from cyberattacks and data loss by securely connecting users, devices, and applications in any location. Distributed across 160+ public exchanges globally and thousands of private exchanges at the edge, the SASE-based Zero Trust Exchange is the world’s largest in-line cloud security platform.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We believe the future of work is Human + AI and are building an AI-native enterprise where human potential is amplified by machine intelligence to solve the world’s hardest security challenges. Driven by deep customer obsession, we are committed to the mission, outcome, and to each other. We bring these commitments to life through three core behaviors: ownership and collaboration, trust through outcomes and impact, and a challenge culture with ongoing feedback. Ready to make an impact at the company pioneering security transformation in the AI era? Join us at Zscaler.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Role&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are looking for a Senior Enterprise Applications Administrator to join our team. This is a hybrid role in San Jose, CA or Remote in Denver, CO, reporting to the Collaboration Solutions Manager in the IT Digital Employee Experience department. In this position, you will support and assist in driving the visionary innovation of Zscaler over the next decade, shaping the future of our technology across collaboration applications and the emerging AI space. You will work closely with support and executive support teams while leading a team to deliver cutting-edge services into both enterprise and FedRAMP environments.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you’ll do (Role Expectations)&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop and articulate the strategic vision for Google Workspace and MS365, aligning with organizational goals and industry best practices, while collaborating with our compliance team on FedRAMP compliance&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead the design, implementation, and optimization of Google Workspace solutions, including email, collaboration tools, and security features, specifically CSE implementation across Gmail, Google Drive, and Google Calendar&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Automate management tasks, such as creation, updates, and deletions for user and group objects within MS365, Google Workspace, Zoom, and Lucid within our FedRAMP environments&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop and drive the strategic vision for the AI-powered collaboration ecosystem, specifically managing the end-to-end lifecycle, roadmap, and operational readiness for both Gemini for Enterprise and Claude Co-Work platforms, ensuring they align with corporate innovation goals and security standards&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead the technical implementation and architectural integration of AI platforms with enterprise applications, deploying Google-managed Model Context Protocol (MCP) servers and Agent Executor frameworks to ensure reliable, high-performance, and secure connectivity across the internal environment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who You Are (Success Profile)&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You thrive in ambiguity and feel comfortable building the path as you walk it, viewing a dynamic environment as an opportunity to construct meaningful solutions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You are a dedicated learner with a growth mindset who actively seeks feedback to continuously develop yourself as a stronger partner and teammate.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You operate with a deep sense of urgency, combining speed and quality to deliver high-impact results with a strong bias for action.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You are data-driven and rely on analytics to uncover facts, measure critical metrics, and substitute assumptions with evidence to achieve optimal outcomes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You lead with integrity by always doing the right thing, maintaining high accountability, and building strong trust through transparent and consistent actions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What We’re Looking for (Minimum Qualifications)&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated curiosity and active exploration of AI tools, with a proven history of integrating new technologies to enhance daily workflows and augment problem-solving&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience driving AI adoption strategies that balance operational autonomy with centralized security control, including defining tiered publication policies for enterprise agents and overseeing the lifecycle governance of AI assets&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;5+ years of experience within Google Workspace and MS365 admin consoles with scripting experience&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven track record in agentic development, including the ability to configure custom data connectors, manage API integrations, and orchestrate multi-agent workflows using frameworks such as Google’s ADK tools within a secure environment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated experience managing identity and access governance (IAM) within high-impact FedRAMP-authorized environments, including scripting for automated user provisioning/deprovisioning and maintaining strict role-based access control (RBAC) and Jump host security protocols&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven ability to support continuous monitoring (ConMon) and audit readiness cycles, including gathering technical evidence or additional requirements to maintain FedRAMP compliance&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What Will Make You Stand Out (Preferred Qualifications)&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Knowledge of FedRAMP standards including IL2/4/5/6, along with experience collaborating with compliance teams and implementing vendor-recommended configurations across respective environments&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience automating user and group onboarding/offboarding, deploying Client Side Encryption (CSE) in Google Workspace, and managing data retention strategies&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong understanding of multi-agent workflows using frameworks such as Google’s ADK tools and establishing MCP connections&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-pay-transparency&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-input&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;description&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;Zscaler’s salary ranges are benchmarked and are determined by role and level. The range displayed on each job posting reflects the minimum and maximum target for new hire salaries for the position across all US locations and could be higher or lower based on a multitude of factors, including job-related skills, experience, and relevant education or training.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The base salary range listed for this full-time position excludes commission/ bonus/ equity (if applicable) + benefits.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;title&quot;&gt;Base Pay Range&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-range&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;$124,000&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;divider&quot;&gt;&amp;mdash;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;$155,000 USD&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p data-pm-slice=&quot;1 3 []&quot;&gt;At Zscaler, we are committed to building a team that reflects the communities we serve and the customers we work with. We foster an inclusive environment that values all backgrounds and perspectives, emphasizing collaboration and belonging. Join us in our mission to make doing business seamless and secure.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our Benefits program is one of the most important ways we support our employees. Zscaler proudly offers comprehensive and inclusive benefits to meet the diverse needs of our employees and their families throughout their life stages, including:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;has-nudge&quot; data-nudge-id=&quot;5eb9419b-6a4d-4451-bfa6-e2eb96084be0&quot;&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Various health plans&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Time off plans for vacation and sick time&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Parental leave options&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Retirement options&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Education reimbursement&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;In-office perks, and more!&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;has-nudge&quot; data-nudge-id=&quot;5eb9419b-6a4d-4451-bfa6-e2eb96084be0&quot;&gt;
&lt;p data-pm-slice=&quot;1 1 []&quot;&gt;Learn more about Zscaler&#39;s hybrid working model and benefits&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.zscaler.com/candidate-resource-hub&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;here&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;By applying for this role, you adhere to applicable laws, regulations, and Zscaler policies, including those related to security and privacy standards and guidelines.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;Zscaler is committed to providing equal employment opportunities to all individuals. We strive to create a workplace where employees are treated with respect and have the chance to succeed. All qualified applicants will be considered for employment without regard to race, color, religion, sex (including pregnancy or related medical conditions), age, national origin, sexual orientation, gender identity or expression, genetic information, disability status, protected veteran status, or any other characteristic protected by federal, state, or local laws. &lt;em&gt;See more information by clicking on the &lt;/em&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.eeoc.gov/sites/default/files/2023-06/22-088_EEOC_KnowYourRights6.12ScreenRdr.pdf&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;Know Your Rights: Workplace Discrimination is Illegal &lt;/em&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;em&gt;link.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Pay Transparency&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Zscaler complies with all applicable federal, state, and local pay transparency rules.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Zscaler is committed to providing reasonable support (called accommodations or adjustments) in our recruiting processes for candidates who are differently abled, have long term conditions, mental health conditions or sincerely held religious beliefs, or who are neurodivergent or require pregnancy-related support.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
